{
 "fps": 30,
 "frames": 1920,
 "dur": 64.0,
 "target": 64.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Commodore Fitz crossed the finish line backwards, sitting on his upside-down boat.",
   "s": 0.12,
   "e": 3.997
  },
  {
   "text": "That morning, he'd sawed off its keel. \"Less boat, more speed!\" So why do sailboats have keels?",
   "s": 4.197,
   "e": 8.754
  },
  {
   "text": "Fitz hung the keel on his wall, like a moose head.",
   "s": 9.054,
   "e": 11.173
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he pointed at Nana June's boat. \"June, your boat is wearing a shark costume!\"",
   "s": 11.373,
   "e": 15.389
  },
  {
   "text": "June didn't answer. Her pig, Truffle, was busy. He'd come for one thing: a suntan.",
   "s": 15.509,
   "e": 19.686
  },
  {
   "text": "Leg one: the wind blew from behind. Fitz shot ahead like toast out of a toaster.",
   "s": 19.886,
   "e": 24.018
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Less boat, more speed!\" he shouted, waving his hat.",
   "s": 24.218,
   "e": 26.551
  },
  {
   "text": "Leg two: the wind blew from the side. June's boat kept sailing straight, like it was on rails.",
   "s": 26.751,
   "e": 31.48
  },
  {
   "text": "But Fitz's boat slid sideways like a hockey puck, right through the fish market.",
   "s": 31.68,
   "e": 35.313
  },
  {
   "text": "Leg three: a gust hit him, and his boat flipped like a pancake.",
   "s": 35.513,
   "e": 38.219
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the wind pushed him all the way back to the start, which was also the finish.",
   "s": 38.419,
   "e": 42.158
  },
  {
   "text": "So what was June's shark costume doing?",
   "s": 42.358,
   "e": 43.902
  },
  {
   "text": "A keel is a big, flat fin under the boat.",
   "s": 44.202,
   "e": 46.113
  },
  {
   "text": "When the wind shoves the boat sideways, the water shoves back on the fin, so the boat slides forward instead.",
   "s": 46.313,
   "e": 51.342
  },
  {
   "text": "And its heavy bottom pulls the boat upright, like a toy that won't stay knocked down.",
   "s": 51.742,
   "e": 55.835
  },
  {
   "text": "June won by a mile, and Truffle got his tan. Sunglasses and all.",
   "s": 56.035,
   "e": 59.501
  },
  {
   "text": "And Fitz has a new motto: \"More boat. Less swimming.\"",
   "s": 59.701,
   "e": 62.011
  }
 ],
